<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 181.41 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS WED.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 181.41 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS WED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 181.41 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Wednesday after selling 89.06 million on Tuesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
